  "body": "## Summary\n- Add a shared per-range dashboard snapshot so overview, models, daily, and usage-history reuse one build instead of re-scanning the same sources.\n- Add lightweight profiling hooks via `DASHBOARD_PROFILE=1` for local diagnostics.\n- Keep the existing dashboard contracts intact and add a regression test for snapshot reuse.\n\n## Verification\n- `uv run python -m unittest tests.test_app tests.test_readme -v`\n- `scripts/review.sh`\n- `uv run python -m py_compile app.py scripts/snapshot_dashboard.py`\n- Playwright smoke on `http://127.0.0.1:8322/?simulate=1`\n- Live endpoint timing checks on `/api/overview`, `/api/models`, `/api/daily`, and `/api/usage-history`\n\n## Notes\n- Top-N changes now only hit `/api/daily`.\n- Range changes still refresh the full dashboard set, but they now reuse a shared snapshot for the same range and source state.",
